# System.md Source Summary

Source document outlining the "System" mental model — a universal conceptual tool for navigating complexity through pattern and relationship recognition. References two canonical sources: John Gall's *The Systems Bible* and Donella H. Meadows' *Thinking in Systems*. Confidence level is 0.7, indicating moderate certainty in its universal applicability.